WEBVTT

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:01.863
After what seems
a long, long time to Sophie,

00:02:01.887 --> 00:02:03.379
a letter arrives.

00:02:03.403 --> 00:02:04.791
It's from her dad.

00:02:04.815 --> 00:02:07.180
The writing is very messy.

00:02:07.204 --> 00:02:11.250
The letter makes her mum cry,
but she reads a little out to Sophie.

00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:14.884
He says that he's OK
and that he's missing them.

00:02:15.744 --> 00:02:17.077
It's a short letter.

00:02:18.006 --> 00:02:21.408
Sophie says she'd like to go
and see her dad, wherever he is.

00:02:21.432 --> 00:02:26.098
But her mum says it's too far away,
and they can't afford the journey.

00:02:26.829 --> 00:02:28.979
Then one day the phone rings.

00:02:29.003 --> 00:02:31.741
"Sophie, come speak to daddy."